## 1. Definitions

For purposes of this License:

**"Software"** means AeoEngine, AeoScript, their source code, editor, runtime, executables, libraries, tools, internal components, and other AEOWUN-owned software distributed as part of AeoEngine.

**"AEOWUN Assets"** means textures, models, audio, graphics, example content, sample projects, scripts, templates, demonstrations, characters, animations, or other creative materials supplied by AEOWUN with AeoEngine or through an official AEOWUN distribution.

**"User Content"** means original code, artwork, textures, models, audio, music, animations, scripts, data, characters, worlds, levels, interfaces, writing, and other materials supplied or created by a user and not owned by AEOWUN.

**"User Project"** means a game, application, simulation, experience, or other original project created using AeoEngine.

**"Built Project"** means a User Project compiled, packaged, exported, or otherwise prepared for execution or distribution using an unmodified copy of AeoEngine.

