## 3. No Modification of AeoEngine or AeoScript

Except with prior written permission from the copyright holder, the Software may not be modified, altered, adapted, translated, patched, forked, rewritten, reverse-engineered into a derivative implementation, or used to create a derivative version of AeoEngine or AeoScript.

Prohibited modifications include, without limitation:

- modified AeoEngine source code;
- modified AeoScript implementation source code;
- modified AeoEngine binaries;
- modified AeoScript binaries or runtime components;
- forks;
- ports;
- derivative engine versions;
- derivative scripting-language implementations based substantially upon the Software;
- patched distributions;
- renamed versions;
- rebranded versions;
- modified editor distributions;
- modified runtime distributions; and
- modified versions distributed under another product or project name.

This section does not prohibit creating original User Content or writing ordinary AeoScript code intended to run inside a User Project.

