## 5. User Content Remains the User's Property

AEOWUN does not claim ownership of original User Content merely because that content was created, imported, authored, edited, tested, compiled, or built using AeoEngine.

Original User Content remains the property of its respective owner.

This includes, without limitation:

- original source code written by the user;
- original AeoScript gameplay scripts written by the user;
- original textures;
- original models;
- original animations;
- original audio;
- original music;
- original graphics;
- original characters;
- original worlds and levels;
- original user interfaces;
- original dialogue and narrative content;
- original project data; and
- other independently created material.

Using AeoEngine does not transfer ownership of User Content to AEOWUN.

AEOWUN does not acquire copyright, publishing rights, revenue participation, royalties, or other ownership interests in a User Project merely because AeoEngine was used to create it.

