## 6. User Projects

A User Project composed of User Content owned or properly licensed by the user remains the user's project.

Subject to the restrictions in this License and any applicable third-party licenses, the user may determine how that User Project is used, licensed, published, distributed, monetized, sold, or otherwise made available.

This permission applies to the User Project and User Content.

It does not transfer any ownership of AeoEngine, AeoScript, AEOWUN Assets, AEOWUN source code, AEOWUN trademarks, or other AEOWUN-owned intellectual property.

Ownership of a User Project and ownership of AeoEngine are separate.

