## 7. Distribution of Built Projects

A Built Project created using an unmodified copy of AeoEngine may be distributed, published, shared, or sold, provided that the distribution complies with this License.

A Built Project may contain runtime components automatically incorporated into the project by AeoEngine where those components are necessary for execution of the Built Project.

This limited permission exists only for distributing the Built Project as a completed project.

It does not permit redistribution of AeoEngine or AeoScript as a standalone product, development environment, SDK, engine package, scripting system, source distribution, or general-purpose runtime.

A Built Project may not include:

- AeoEngine source code;
- AeoScript implementation source code;
- the AeoEngine editor;
- development tooling intended to reproduce or redistribute AeoEngine;
- source files from the Software that are not necessary user-authored project files;
- a separately reusable copy of AeoEngine;
- a separately reusable copy of the AeoScript runtime or implementation;
- an engine package intended for use in creating other projects; or
- any representation that the recipient has received a license to AeoEngine itself beyond components necessarily embedded in the Built Project.

Distribution of a Built Project does not constitute permission to redistribute the Software itself.

