- receive revenue from the User Project; and
- otherwise commercially exploit the user's original project.

No royalty, ownership interest, revenue share, or payment to AEOWUN is created solely because an unmodified copy of AeoEngine was used to create the project.

This commercial-project permission does not grant permission to commercially redistribute AeoEngine, AeoScript, AEOWUN source code, or restricted AEOWUN Assets.

