- demonstrations; and
- non-commercial development.

AEOWUN Assets may not be assumed to be licensed for commercial publication or redistribution merely because they are bundled with AeoEngine.

Users intending to commercially publish or broadly distribute a User Project are strongly encouraged to use assets that they created themselves or assets for which they independently possess the required rights.

Without separate permission or a separate asset license, AEOWUN Assets may not be:

- sold;
- sublicensed;
- redistributed as standalone assets;
- included in commercial asset packs;
- represented as user-created assets;
- extracted and redistributed independently of AeoEngine; or
- used commercially where this License does not expressly authorize that use.

Removing, renaming, converting, modifying, or repackaging an AEOWUN Asset does not transfer ownership of that asset.

