## 13. Separation of Engine and Project Ownership

For clarity:

**AeoEngine belongs to AEOWUN.**

**AeoScript and its implementation belong to AEOWUN.**

**AEOWUN Assets belong to AEOWUN or their respective identified owners.**

**User Content belongs to the user or its respective owner.**

**A User Project built from user-owned or properly licensed materials belongs to the user with respect to those materials.**

Using AeoEngine does not give AEOWUN ownership of the user's project.

Owning a User Project does not give the user ownership of AeoEngine or AeoScript.

Distributing a Built Project does not grant recipients the right to extract, redistribute, modify, sublicense, or repurpose AeoEngine or AeoScript independently from that Built Project.

